  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of scale, location and potential impact on the neighbouring amenity, is considered to harm the character and appearance of the host property and surrounding area. Due to the proximity and location, the scheme would have an impact on surrounding residential occupiers in terms of access to light and causes a crowded outlook on the rear garden of the host property.. The proposal would therefore not be in accordance with policies LP1, LP2 and LP5 of the Wandsworth Local Plan (2023); and the Local Plan SPD 'Housing' (2016)."
